<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S4a" title="In Task-Aware Image Signal Processor for Advanced Visual Perception" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>More Visualization Results</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
